\\\n\\\\nRecord shell-edited test files larger than the retained snapshot as unverifiable changes, and record when the bounded workspace scan is incomplete while regression obligations are active. The existing full-snapshot behavior and non-obligation path remain unchanged.\\\\n\\\\n## Verification\\\\n\\\\n-  — 21 passed, 0 failed.\\\\n- \\n> local-code-harness@1.2.1 build\\n> tsc && node scripts/copy_data.mjs && node scripts/write_build_info.mjs — passed.\\\\n-  — passed.\\\\n\\\\n## Reference coding\\\\n\\\\n- Queried Nexus  and  via XERJ; confirmed the missing propagation of snapshot completeness and the raw-text-only dispatch condition.\\\\n- Queried the OpenCode corpus for analogous bounded verification snapshots; no relevant analogue was found, so no peer pattern was adopted.\\\\n- Field report submitted; the XERJ GitHub fork path was unavailable and the report was stored via the fallback endpoint.\\\\n\\\\n## Acceptance\\\\n\\\\n- A shell edit to a test file larger than 64 KiB is recorded as  against active obligations.\\\\n- An incomplete 20,000-entry workspace scan is recorded against active obligations, even when no scanned file changed.\\\\n- Existing focused shell-guard and obligation tests pass.\",\"headRefOid\":\"ab5a382e1957a5ed59130da1a959562728375685\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/44611609826/job/135869395950\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T20:43:44Z\",\"status\":\"QUEUED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/44611609577/job/135869396889\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T20:43:44Z\",\"status\":\"QUEUED\",\"workflowName\":\"CodeQL\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-