{"timestamp":"2026-11-19T20:43:48.686Z","ordinal":28131,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1f58d-1e4e-72a3-b6c2-8ebed34be745","call_id":"call_b6041ec2e6f44f7e82073d418f09b70b","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.3 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"## Problem and resulting behavior\n\nExplain the user-visible problem and what this change does. Link issues and requirement IDs where applicable.\n\n## Validation\n\nList commands, results, tested revision/environment, and material gaps. Distinguish existing evidence from checks run for this PR.\n\n## Reference coding\n\nQueries run (`xerj code ...`) and what was taken, borrowed or rejected; or \"Not applicable\" (trivial, docs-only or test-specified change); or \"XERJ unavailable: <reason>\".\n\n## Compatibility, security, and recovery\n\nDescribe relevant permission, persistence/schema, configuration, installation, or release impacts. Use “not applicable” where appropriate.\n\n## Documentation and coordination\n\n- [ ] Scope and documentation match the final implementation.\n- [ ] Relevant checks pass, or blockers are explicitly identified.\n- [ ] No secrets, private task payloads, or unrelated changes are included.\n- [ ] Shared-file ownership and dependencies are coordinated where applicable.\n\nRecord material AI assistance and independent review when used.\n\n## Needs from other slices\n\nList dependencies/handoffs, or write “None.”\n{\"baseRefOid\":\"88078bdb5f34b7817116279304ee156f49e3653d\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\\\n\\\\nRecord shell-edited test files larger than the retained snapshot as unverifiable changes, and record when the bounded workspace scan is incomplete while regression obligations are active. The existing full-snapshot behavior and non-obligation path remain unchanged.\\\\n\\\\n## Verification\\\\n\\\\n-  — 21 passed, 0 failed.\\\\n- \\n> local-code-harness@1.2.1 build\\n> tsc && node scripts/copy_data.mjs && node scripts/write_build_info.mjs — passed.\\\\n-  — passed.\\\\n\\\\n## Reference coding\\\\n\\\\n- Queried Nexus  and  via XERJ; confirmed the missing propagation of snapshot completeness and the raw-text-only dispatch condition.\\\\n- Queried the OpenCode corpus for analogous bounded verification snapshots; no relevant analogue was found, so no peer pattern was adopted.\\\\n- Field report submitted; the XERJ GitHub fork path was unavailable and the report was stored via the fallback endpoint.\\\\n\\\\n## Acceptance\\\\n\\\\n- A shell edit to a test file larger than 64 KiB is recorded as  against active obligations.\\\\n- An incomplete 20,000-entry workspace scan is recorded against active obligations, even when no scanned file changed.\\\\n- Existing focused shell-guard and obligation tests pass.\",\"headRefOid\":\"ab5a382e1957a5ed59130da1a959562728375685\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/44611609826/job/135869395950\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T20:43:44Z\",\"status\":\"QUEUED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/44611609577/job/135869396889\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T20:43:44Z\",\"status\":\"QUEUED\",\"workflowName\":\"CodeQL\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/44611609826/job/135869395476\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T20:43:44Z\",\"status\":\"QUEUED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/