{"timestamp":"2026-11-19T20:44:47.924Z","ordinal":28159,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76","turn_id":"01a1f580-fbbd-7c63-b412-737898b1a440","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_007c6624f07d1d76016aff5fbe52f487d19c1f38441a2d9f51","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The VC-2 fix is published as PR #642 and its focused checks pass; hosted checks are still running. I also found PR #639’s required Entire gate failed after its test matrix passed, so I’m checking the failure reason before deciding whether it’s an approval-only block or needs a code/metadata correction. In parallel I’m mapping Claude’s remaining commits to current `main` and open PRs, without importing the old branch wholesale."}],"phase":"commentary"},"content_token_count":91,"started_at_ms":1795121086502,"completed_at_ms":1795121087924}}
