{"timestamp":"2026-11-20T03:45:45.040Z","ordinal":28623,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76","turn_id":"01a1f70b-846a-7860-9aa2-ec3e0d5fdc10","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_05793ea695c2aa2c016affc267a4b087d2ab3de727d3b1ddd4","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The live v1.2.2 backlog still has a few implementation items independent of model spend or runner expansion. I’m checking the remaining CS-6 real-server coverage next: specifically, whether the sandbox refusal path can be tested with the existing weekly real LSP setup without new infrastructure or weakening its non-required status."}],"phase":"commentary"},"content_token_count":65,"started_at_ms":1795146343697,"completed_at_ms":1795146345040}}
