{"timestamp":"2026-11-20T03:56:53.248Z","ordinal":29005,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76","turn_id":"01a1f712-aaf3-7db1-9f93-ddce93b124cb","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-857a5c77-6cf7-42c6-8fa8-76c83502610a","process_id":"34420","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 643 --json body --jq .body"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 643 --json body --jq .body"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"## Summary\n- Pin the hosted LSP integration environment to Go 1.27.4, Rust 1.95.0 with rust-analyzer, and gopls v0.24.0.\n- Make setup failures fatal so the four server cases cannot silently become skipped coverage.\n- Update the LSP validation record with the pinned versions and their hosted-run basis.\n\n## Verification\n- `actionlint .github/workflows/lsp-real-servers.yml` passed.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n- A new hosted run against this branch is still required to verify the updated setup and all four real servers.\n\n## Reference coding\n- Queried XERJ's `opencode` corpus and `nexus-docs` index for real-server workflow setup patterns. The available passages were not relevant to version pinning, so no peer implementation was borrowed. Followed the repository's existing pinned `actions/setup-go` action and version pattern. XERJ feedback was submitted.\n\n## Review\n- This is a single-maintainer repository. No second maintainer is available; the change is published for CI and owner review without making a second-reviewer account a gate.\n\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":393846428}},"started_at_ms":1795147012854,"completed_at_ms":1795147013248}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-20T03:56:53.421Z","ordinal":29006,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1f719-9d2d-74b2-8c20-14d0ed29cd6c","call_id":"call_4405398c0ab946a9bca55ac9491c01e9","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.8 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"## Summary\n- Pin the hosted LSP integration environment to Go 1.27.4, Rust 1.95.0 with rust-analyzer, and gopls v0.24.0.\n- Make setup failures fatal so the four server cases cannot silently become skipped coverage.\n- Update the LSP validation record with the pinned versions and their hosted-run basis.\n\n## Verification\n- `actionlint .github/workflows/lsp-real-servers.yml` passed.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n- A new hosted run against this branch is still required to verify the updated setup and all four real servers.\n\n## Reference coding\n- Queried XERJ's `opencode` corpus and `nexus-docs` index for real-server workflow setup patterns. The available passages were not relevant to version pinning, so no peer implementation was borrowed. Followed the repository's existing pinned `actions/setup-go` action and version pattern. XERJ feedback was submitted.\n\n## Review\n- This is a single-maintainer repository. No second maintainer is available; the change is published for CI and owner review without making a second-reviewer account a gate.\n\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1f712-aaf3-7db1-9f93-ddce93b124cb","create_time":1795147013.4213798}},"metadata":{"history_sequence":12798,"sampled_through_sequence":12795,"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
