{"timestamp":"2026-11-20T04:00:00.593Z","ordinal":29105,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76","turn_id":"01a1f712-aaf3-7db1-9f93-ddce93b124cb","session_id":"01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76","root_turn_id":"01a1f712-aaf3-7db1-9f93-ddce93b124cb","response_id":"resp_05793ea695c2aa2c016affc5b4f78087d2894a3efd5813f879","usage":{"input_tokens":140712,"cached_input_tokens":134400,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":607,"reasoning_output_tokens":494,"total_tokens":141319},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":4582419,"cached_input_tokens":4475520,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":22609,"reasoning_output_tokens":14625,"total_tokens":4605028},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":608529801,"cached_input_tokens":601687680,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1293276,"reasoning_output_tokens":676496,"total_tokens":609823077}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-20T04:00:03.956Z","ordinal":29106,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76","turn_id":"01a1f712-aaf3-7db1-9f93-ddce93b124cb","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-94a398b2-402c-4bc2-ac79-5d0fa0abe1dd","process_id":"67236","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","xerj search --prefix nexus-docs 'invariant document code test mapping checker CI' -k 3 --full 250 && git show --stat --oneline b5d36352 && git show --format= --name-only b5d36352 | sed -n '1,100p'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"xerj search --prefix nexus-docs 'invariant document code test mapping checker CI' -k 3 --full 250 && git show --stat --oneline b5d36352 && git show --format= --name-only b5d36352 | sed -n '1,100p'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"\n─── v1.1.4/PLAN.md:16  (score 1002.00)\n    outside the repository.\n    - One exact-head gate per release candidate, run with the CI fixture variables set so `make test` runs through, in a clean worktree with its own `npm ci`.\n    \n    ## 2. Findings ledger\n    \n    **Numbering.** `WP-1301` to `WP-1308`, `WP-1310\n    … (--full 500 to see more)\n\n─── v1.1.4/PLAN.md:61  (score 1002.00)\n    needs the shared `GATEWAY` claim. Until measured it stays \"not met\".\n    - Test gaps: 404 and thrown-exception kind retention, `agent_observer` isolation of the two normaliser layers, required-null rejection.\n    \n    ### WP-1304 Evaluation CLI, tracing and reda\n    … (--full 500 to see more)\n\n─── v1.0.0/READINESS.md:63  (score 1001.00)\n    publication authorization remains gated by acceptance.\n    \n    The checkpoints below are retained as historical evidence; their source revision, PR, CI, and qualification statements are superseded by this observation.\n    \n    ## Historical checkpoint (observed 202\n    … (--full 500 to see more)\n\n3 passage(s) from 'nexus-docs-*'. Cite ax_path:line (ax_path#locator for a data row) for anything you rely on.\nb5d36352 docs: engineering invariants map (+checker), agent rules, roadmap EI rows, stale doc headers\n .github/workflows/ci.yml                           |  1 +\n AGENTS.md                                          |  6 +++\n CHANGELOG.md                                       |  3 ++\n cli/test/invariants_doc.test.ts                    | 13 ++++++\n docs/ARCHITECTURE.md                               |  4 ++\n docs/EXECUTION_CONVERGENCE.md                      |  2 +-\n docs/INVARIANTS.md                                 | 48 ++++++++++++++++++++\n .../v1.2.0/SEMANTIC_AND_ARCHITECTURAL_INTEGRITY.md |  2 +-\n docs/v1.2.1/PLAN.md                                | 14 ++++++\n scripts/check_invariants.mjs                       | 53 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n 10 files changed, 144 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\n.github/workflows/ci.yml\nAGENTS.md\nCHANGELOG.md\ncli/test/invariants_doc.test.ts\ndocs/ARCHITECTURE.md\ndocs/EXECUTION_CONVERGENCE.md\ndocs/INVARIANTS.md\ndocs/v1.2.0/SEMANTIC_AND_ARCHITECTURAL_INTEGRITY.md\ndocs/v1.2.1/PLAN.md\nscripts/check_invariants.mjs\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":3,"nanos":154169003}},"started_at_ms":1795147200801,"completed_at_ms":1795147203956}}
