{"timestamp":"2026-11-20T04:05:06.878Z","ordinal":29303,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76","turn_id":"01a1f712-aaf3-7db1-9f93-ddce93b124cb","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_05793ea695c2aa2c016affc6f10a4887d2845b28b6fcfaa64e","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The CS-6 workflow run passed all 10 real-server tests with the pinned Go/Rust toolchains and no skips. I also checked the Claude candidate’s invariant-map change against current `main`; its checker currently fails because several code and test files it requires are still absent, so I stopped that cherry-pick instead of publishing a misleading gate. I’m separating candidate work that’s already landed from genuinely outstanding work before bringing any of it over."}],"phase":"commentary"},"content_token_count":91,"started_at_ms":1795147505135,"completed_at_ms":1795147506877}}
