{"timestamp":"2026-11-20T04:05:47.274Z","ordinal":29343,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76","turn_id":"01a1f712-aaf3-7db1-9f93-ddce93b124cb","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-4af1fa3a-9e4f-47ce-a3d0-2faba8869da8","process_id":"27396","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","tmpHome=$(mktemp -d)\nHOME=\"$tmpHome\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$tmpHome/.config\" node --import tsx --test test/content_tool_call.test.ts"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code/cli","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"tmpHome=$(mktemp -d)\nHOME=\"$tmpHome\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$tmpHome/.config\" node --import tsx --test test/content_tool_call.test.ts"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"✔ a reply that is only the arguments of the one offered tool, or a named offered call, is call-shaped (6.763616ms)\n✔ short or generic values found in an earlier tool result do not make a call an echo (1.728941ms)\n✔ the model repeating its own earlier call is still call-shaped (only what the request carried from others counts as an echo) (0.582195ms)\n✔ nothing else is call-shaped: prose, repair-needing JSON, unknown or missing keys, wrong types, bare arguments among many tools, echoes, existing calls (3.614147ms)\n[nexus] endpoint answered a tool request with the call as text; telling it so and asking again.\n✔ a call returned as reply text is never run as text: the client tells the model and uses the native call it then makes (199.428546ms)\n[nexus] endpoint answered a tool request with the call as text; telling it so and asking again.\n[nexus] endpoint wrote the call as text again; asking once more with tool_choice=required.\n✔ a model that writes the call as text again after the note is asked once more with tool_choice=required (53.696811ms)\n[nexus] endpoint answered a tool request with the call as text; telling it so and asking again.\n✔ a model that was only quoting JSON answers the note in prose: that answer is used and nothing is forced or run (25.668114ms)\n[nexus] endpoint answered a tool request with the call as text; telling it so and asking again.\n[nexus] endpoint wrote the call as text again; asking once more with tool_choice=required.\n[nexus] endpoint (m) did not return a native tool call even when one was required; call-like text is never executed. Check that the selected model or server supports tool calls.\n✔ if neither retry yields a native call the original reply stands, is not executed, and there is no fourth request (47.069748ms)\n[nexus] endpoint answered a tool request with the call as text; telling it so and asking again.\n[nexus] endpoint answered a tool request with the call as text; telling it so and asking again.\n✔ the same holds for a streamed request, and neither the retry turns nor the marker reach a provider or the history (50.268379ms)\n✔ an echo of JSON the request contained, an ordinary answer, and a native call each cost exactly one request (28.176787ms)\n[nexus] endpoint answered a tool request with the call as text; telling it so and asking again.\n[nexus] Asking endpoint again for a native tool call failed (Inference error (HTTP 400): {\"error\":{\"message\":\"boom\"}}); keeping its first reply.\n[nexus] endpoint answered a tool request with the call as text; telling it so and asking again.\n[nexus] endpoint wrote the call as text again; asking once more with tool_choice=required.\n[nexus] Asking endpoint again for a native tool call failed (Inference error (HTTP 400): {\"error\":{\"message\":\"boom\"}}); keeping its first reply.\n✔ a retry that fails keeps the usable first reply instead of failing the turn; the failed answer is never run (51.698387ms)\n[nexus] endpoint answered a tool request with the call as text; telling it so and asking again.\n[nexus] endpoint wrote the call as text again; asking once more with tool_choice=required.\n[nexus] endpoint (m) did not return a native tool call even when one was required; call-