{"timestamp":"2026-11-20T04:12:43.755Z","ordinal":29513,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76","turn_id":"01a1f724-b429-78b2-be94-d00e18b12d93","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-34768b8f-4fbe-4fbc-abfc-54541368f84c","process_id":"1401","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git cherry -v origin/main v1/invariants-audit | sed -n '1,80p'; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/invariants status --short --branch"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git cherry -v origin/main v1/invariants-audit | sed -n '1,80p'; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/invariants status --short --branch"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"+ be56c8ca451768960b52d1ae42ac8063aacd15ad docs(tasks): invariants + change-cost audit plan and lessons\n+ 4a5401ba3004404c896d5b7fae6aee53e2cbf887 fix(cli): unknown tool-call outcome is never replayed or reported as failure (I-EFFECT-1/2/3)\n+ 7c46ac0988fa7a342bdbacca61a7597359c94225 fix(cli): operation run refuses an existing id; resume/decide re-read under the driver lock (I-LIFE-1)\n+ c48bd44beeb185f099dbc29e9c347a6b6960f4e3 fix(cli): operation record validates status enums and dependsOn at load; COMPLETE never regresses on save (I-LIFE-1)\n+ 5c97e6c9d2ac7c45b0787028c05459e78570be55 fix(cli): repo .nexus-security.json cannot weaken verification protection in an untrusted workspace (I-AUTH-1)\n+ 10fac16e600c2876e7058a0bf9e35a1acea79e74 fix(cli): MCP/plugin tools register as extension capabilities (D1); completion receipt binds real verifier output (D6)\n+ 89c82fc730a99b05266644f5c395ed51a341b9fd fix(cli): subagents discover their connection's limits (P2); one success predicate for turn surfaces (E3)\n+ 620736b0c033998cf41cf95025546a4b2cc92398 feat(cli): change-scope rules in the implementer prompt (R3, I-CHANGE-1)\n+ d09f35d4c6683b31b9a25aad152e3a31827a9dbf fix(cli): openai-chat finish_reason=content_filter is not a complete answer (P3, I-PROVIDER-2)\n+ 3db252f14eb48975c9dd49a8e453d6ec9b756c70 fix(cli): provider base-URL override obeys the provider-file URL rules (A4, I-AUTH-3)\n+ b9d72d6a777cadb5fe8ecf41f2fdb2acf5ef4962 fix(cli): dry-run simulates every mutating capability the bridge does not (D2, I-EFFECT-4)\n+ 82d5d50815b0656c08b9219a81c73b8b58c160cd feat(cli): engineering review contract on the existing review verdict (R2, I-CHANGE-2)\n+ a3dbd5d110c4a011378884092bd536ad8989e1f4 test(ceri): change-cost scenarios A-H on the review contract, dry-run and lifecycle rules\n+ b5d363526959f202b12ba4d7dcf0d8e91376e17b docs: engineering invariants map (+checker), agent rules, roadmap EI rows, stale doc headers\n+ 68a8c7098dee801bfa1737a3e0a0e4bf8965448d fix(cli): unitOutcome named (E4), decision kinds validated at load (D4), durable private writers (A2); review notes\n+ 56cfc2943d79246f3aba4039e85f64adc18a3456 docs(tasks): final regression result\n+ f081aee7ca89ce70974654187fe8264d53b81234 docs(tasks): like-for-like baseline result\n+ 78e95db71a8bde4df01ebecac566bbdf1c7a6b23 docs(tasks): Node 22 result for the changed tests\n+ 62d7aa9d4e493aea796eab10ed1255f27dd605b9 docs(tasks): full Node 22 suite result\n+ 5ecb0d8ffc56589f2dfaee4a4b793d3d5dfec4cd docs: decide EI-1 (intent-write failure stays fail-open, loudly) and record it\n+ e6fc962fc628e59c170decd6e4fc34ce553278cc fix(cli): plugin hooks see copies of args (I-AUTH-4); OAuth refresh single-flight (I-AUTH-5); EI-2 closed, pinned\n+ 044aac9dea6bdfc8ee332290bf0fd00f7d3bb36d docs(tasks): final full-suite numbers\n+ b241868427583b521fae0e66f26efa3f2055012d fix(cli): upgrade lock stale across reboot/age (I-LIFE-3); browser_click is mutating (EI-6)\n+ 5b3f29cf27d03400026215d71c50b54a63d4ba69 docs(tasks): final regression numbers on b2418684\n+ 71685679193dfdf65f2ab227c7443c2791e40cb5 fix(cli): cross-process OAuth refresh guard, doctor lock mid-write window, checkpoint restore journal event (EI-3, EI-4)\n+ 492033e685411cf90afad37989449defc0abfcea docs: decide EI-7 (spine hooks stay extension seams; guards stay), tidy known-gaps table\n+ f7aa3919620c015e3e8b13ecd5cd461cf52a0fd3 docs: no document claims a hash-chained audit; correct the gap table\n+ 91f69fb116b11eb0ebc6baefa19e82d05e6ed97c docs(tasks): final regression record\n+ 9b3aa4342c5fa8b3211a94ee95ebf14b0db4ef46 docs(tasks): Node 22 full suite on the final tree\n+ fae50f80b208e6619642bb6ba8b02446b8b31a1d eval: five change-cost tasks and the first live run (base 14/25, branch 20/25; suggestive, n=5 per cell)\n+ 7aa7414abb213d2a26a4a926b1a4a047567fc08f eval: cc-deliberate-abstraction objective says quotes are not part of the value\n+ c9cc113979b5468b177bd43e58c26951363908b4 eval: second live change-cost run (10 per cell): base and branch tie at 37/50; run 1 gap did not replicate\n+ e743ac2dbde95694ab9e54e933c9b6dae205680e fix(cli): report a connection that cannot make tool calls even when required (I-PROVIDER-3, EI-6)\n+ 9b05ac1d965ac403accff8f64b63bab44a5ca2a2 eval: pilot config for the second gateway model (engineering/deep)\n+ 9fa18cfdcceed8e4c0a1d80f0ef602f0d8a8cd09 eval: deep pilot config uses the model's advertised 12288 output limit\n## v1/invariants-audit...origin/main [ahead 35, behind 171]\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":784103631}},"started_at_ms":1795147962970,"completed_at_ms":1795147963755}}
