l: Use when t (file: r1/recall/SKILL.md)\n- receiving-code-review: Use when rec (file: r1/receiving-code-review/SKILL.md)\n- refactor-legacy-code: Modernize  (file: r1/refactor-legacy-code/SKILL.md)\n- replay: Use when t (file: r1/replay/SKILL.md)\n- requesting-code-review: Use when c (file: r1/requesting-code-review/SKILL.md)\n- resend-setup: Configure  (file: r1/resend-setup/SKILL.md)\n- responsive-web-design: Create respo (file: r1/responsive-web-design/SKILL.md)\n- rest-api-design: Design RESTf (file: r1/rest-api-design/SKILL.md)\n- retro: Weekly en (file: r0/gstack-retro/SKILL.md)\n- reverse-engineer-anything: Reverse engi (file: r1/reverse-engineer-anything/SKILL.md)\n- review: Review cod (file: r1/review/SKILL.md)\n- review: Pre-landing (file: r0/gstack-review/SKILL.md)\n- running-marketing: Use this ski (file: r1/running-marketing/SKILL.md)\n- scrape: Pull data f (file: r0/gstack-scrape/SKILL.md)\n- scrum-sage: AI-powered (file: r1/scrum-sage/SKILL.md)\n- secrets-management: Implement  (file: r1/secrets-management/SKILL.md)\n- session-crosslink: Use when an  (file: r1/session-crosslink/SKILL.md)\n- session-handoff: Use when the (file: r1/session-handoff/SKILL.md)\n- session-log: Summarize th (file: r1/session-log/SKILL.md)\n- session-to-skill: Use when t (file: r1/session-to-skill/SKILL.md)\n- setting-pricing: Use this ski (file: r1/setting-pricing/SKILL.md)\n- setup-browser-cookies: Import co (file: r0/gstack-setup-browser-cookies/SKILL.md)\n- setup-deploy: Configure d (file: r0/gstack-setup-deploy/SKILL.md)\n- setup-gbrain: Set up gbra (file: r0/gstack-setup-gbrain/SKILL.md)\n- shadcn-ui-setup: Add Shadcn U (file: r1/shadcn-ui-setup/SKILL.md)\n- shiki-code-blocks: Syntax highl (file: r1/shiki-code-blocks/SKILL.md)\n- ship: Ship workfl (file: r0/gstack-ship/SKILL.md)\n- ship-learn-next: Transfor (file: r1/ship-learn-next/SKILL.md)\n- sites:sites: Use Sites  (file: r6/sites/SKILL.md)\n- sites:sites-remix: Remix a Si (file: r6/sites-remix/SKILL.md)\n- skill-b