{"timestamp":"2026-11-20T04:25:15.947Z","ordinal":30016,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76","turn_id":"01a1f730-5dda-7050-8748-e755b63ef781","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_05793ea695c2aa2c016affcbaa4f0887d2a91faffdfccd729f","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’ve recorded your decision to defer paid-infrastructure items for v1.2.x. For session forks, I’ll evaluate the user-facing and data-safety tradeoff and proceed with the safest complete behavior. The current implementation refuses forks from worktree-bound sessions because two sessions would otherwise share a checkout; I’m tracing how Nexus owns and cleans up those worktrees before changing that path."}],"phase":"commentary"},"content_token_count":79,"started_at_ms":1795148714362,"completed_at_ms":1795148715946}}
