{"timestamp":"2026-11-20T06:42:10.920Z","ordinal":32892,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_05793ea695c2aa2c016affebb976b087d2801c6c0d56cc0ec2","status":"completed","call_id":"call_514fb0517938454fb3059ecb72e1dfe9","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/v1-2x-backlog-reconcile/docs/v1.2.2/BACKLOG.md\\n@@\\n-## Out of scope without donated capacity; no paid infrastructure is planned\\n+## External-capacity limits; no paid infrastructure is planned\\n@@\\n-| MQ-1, MQ-2 | Benchmark adapter (Harbor / Terminal-Bench) and the false-completion report (pass rate, claimed-done-but-wrong, verified-but-wrong, Wilson intervals, peer comparison) | No paid inference or benchmark service. D3/D4 already decide the publication rule (publish nothing before a result) and measurement class (small self-run E1); the pinned subset remains an owner choice. | Build or retain the adapter against a mock gateway. Run a live subset only on donated capacity or an available no-cost local endpoint; otherwise keep live results unpublished and the work out of scope. |\\n+| MQ-1, MQ-2 live benchmark | Empirical false-completion report (pass rate, claimed-done-but-wrong, verified-but-wrong, Wilson intervals, peer comparison) | No paid inference or benchmark service. D3/D4 already decide the publication rule (publish nothing before a result) and measurement class (small self-run E1); the pinned subset remains an owner choice. | Run a live subset only on donated capacity or an available no-cost local endpoint; otherwise keep live results unpublished and out of scope. |\\n@@\\n-## No-cost work that remains actionable\\n+## No-cost work that remains actionable\\n@@\\n | Unit | Not done | First step |\\n |---|---|---|\\n+| MQ-1, MQ-2 adapter | Benchmark adapter and false-completion report; no live benchmark result exists. | Build and test the adapter against a mock gateway with synthetic results. This does not require 