{"timestamp":"2026-11-20T07:51:50.515Z","ordinal":33729,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1f7f0-b7f3-71f1-a406-8ca9f9487f5d","call_id":"call_fc17df99e10747ae84fb31a5a6eba527","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.3 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 1233)\nTotal output lines: 21\n\n1:# Task Group: Nexus v1.2.x backlog audit and VC-2 shell verification\n2:scope: Audit v1.2.x backlog and PR gates, and investigate bounded shell snapshots under regression obligations.\n3:applies_to: cwd=/home/mike/nexus-code and isolated /home/mike/nexus-wt worktrees; reuse_rule=recheck current code, claims, PR heads, hosted checks, and backlog; observed PR status is historical.\n5:## Task 1: Audit v1.2.x backlog and reconcile PR state, partial\n7:- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/home/mike/nexus-code, rollout_path=/home/mike/.codex/sessions/2026/11/18/rollout-2026-11-18T21-29-30-01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76.jsonl, updated_at=2026-11-19T20:54:31+00:00, thread_id=01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76, partial; recheck current state)\n9:- docs/v1.2.2/BACKLOG.md, PR #631, PR #639, PR #642, Entire, apt-get install, invariants, v1.2.x\n12:- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/home/mike/nexus-code, rollout_path=/home/mike/.codex/sessions/2026/11/18/rollout-2026-11-18T21-29-30-01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76.jsonl, updated_at=2026-11-19T20:54:31+00:00, thread_id=01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76, partial; recheck current state)\n17:- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/home/mike/nexus-code, rollout_path=/home/mike/.codex/sessions/2026/11/18/rollout-2026-11-18T21-29-30-01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76.jsonl, updated_at=2026-11-19T20:54:31+00:00, thread_id=01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76, partial; recheck current state)\n35:applies_to: cwd=/home/mike/nexus-code and /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-release; reuse_rule=recheck heads, clai