{"timestamp":"2026-11-20T07:52:11.095Z","ordinal":33747,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76","turn_id":"01a1f730-5dda-7050-8748-e755b63ef781","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_05793ea695c2aa2c016afffc29cca487d2804aa73d78f2267a","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Agreed: paid services and paid runners are not part of the plan. The backlog already records the live benchmarks and provider checks as donation/no-cost contingent. I’m continuing with the remaining no-cost items and checking claims before touching any files; the main-branch CI run is still in progress, while CodeQL has passed."}],"phase":"commentary"},"content_token_count":66,"started_at_ms":1795161129829,"completed_at_ms":1795161131095}}
