d additive WP-1109 memory roadmap and README links in isolated worktree; preserve existing dependency planning on docs-post-v1 branch; no product code or v1.0 acceptance changes\",\n  \"head\": \"fbee269aa46912fae31ed1a202fc47790ef19cf0\",\n  \"status\": \"Documentation checks passed; local commit prepared for owner integration into existing docs-post-v1 roadmap branch; no push or merge; file claims released\"\n}\nEVAL_T4_OVERLOAD_DIAGNOSTIC_20261030.released-20261105T142659Z {\n  \"agent\": \"/root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/eval-t4-overload-diagnostic\",\n  \"base\": \"16eeb6eeffe7fc0bae234aa34dcb671a6ba5ff99\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-30T08:26:48Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"Improve diagnostics for two historical synthetic evaluator failures in eval_harness.test.ts: T4 overloaded smoke missing model telemetry (PR334) and peer fake-OpenCode hiddenPass false (PR338); diagnostic-only assertions, no product behavior change, no held-out access; run focused cases only after hosted SUITE clears.\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-t4-overload-diagnostic\",\n  \"head\": \"c6f00e8f27c0af1a80e7131f8a6f52efa4aa0321\",\n  \"status\": \"Focused synthetic tests PASS on source base 890c553d after CI-equivalent CLI build and Rust release build: T4 overloaded endpoint smoke and fake OpenCode peer version/budget case (2 passed, 0 failed). Independent read-only review ACCEPT on exact unchanged diff SHA-256 d4b51c5450d98343c3cd7e6cd7fe216363541b11f3df97c5bfaa847d88b7d2a3. Rebased commit c6f00e8f onto origin/main 16eeb6ee; targeted rerun pending because hosted SUITE 41029564419 Node22/24 full suites remain active. Synthetic only, no held-out tasks. On rebased exact candidate c6f00e8f27c0af1a80e7131f8a6f52efa4aa0321 (differs from origin/main only by diagnostics test file), requirements enforcement PASS (123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 mapped exact-RC deferrals), sync-version --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.14 PASS, diff-check PASS. These are