{"timestamp":"2026-11-20T07:52:37.211Z","ordinal":33765,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76","turn_id":"01a1f730-5dda-7050-8748-e755b63ef781","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_05793ea695c2aa2c016afffc41c4c887d2907f9302308cc07e","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Understood. Nexus Code’s v1.2.x plan will assume **no paid infrastructure now or later** unless it is donated. Missing paid runners, API credits, or an outside reviewer won’t be treated as prerequisites for publishing.\n\nI checked the current backlog: it still lists no-cost work, including the mock benchmark adapter and CI-time improvements, alongside some partially completed verification items. Live benchmarks and provider checks remain out of scope without donated or otherwise free capacity. At `87bf1a7`, CodeQL has passed; main CI is still running. I’ll keep those statuses and remaining work distinct from completed items."}],"phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":{"entries":[{"path":"MEMORY.md","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":12,"note":"checked current v1.2.x backlog context and re-verified live state"}],"rolloutIds":[]}},"content_token_count":186,"started_at_ms":1795161153797,"completed_at_ms":1795161157211}}
